{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_title", "source_sha256": "4d4799ed357dab9d10ab89fab1ea932d4aa3b9aae4680656dd4f9caec38026f0", "ja": "ouverture：深層マーメイド", "zh": "ouverture：深层人鱼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "079d0a706cc25a0a86ccc7a01f2baf5a709c2555bfad54e55548e57b11d7747c", "ja": "ひとりは、誰よりも輝くために……\nそしてもうひとりは、その背中を追って……\nやがて、人魚達は踊る。\n燃えるような光の中で。", "zh": "一个人，为了绽放出胜过所有人的光芒……\n而另一个人，则追随着她的背影……\n终于，人鱼们翩翩起舞。\n在如火焰般燃烧的光芒中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ee81e0f4526596df1e9ef3b087cc48b9523552b8837d4bf41fd8312910b4240e", "ja": "『アイメガ』？\nTVで毎年やってる『アイメガ』ですか？", "zh": "『爱豆大狂欢』？\n是电视上每年都在播的那个『爱豆大狂欢』吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "27a2725652b7a7bf41628e180068b39c899ce16d39aac929834b0cb82dbe8ee3", "ja": "え？　{$P$}、\n自分達、『アイメガ』に出ていいの！？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，\n我们真的可以参加《爱巨星》吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "a1dcce6181bc4361bba53ae530b25f6fdca9e942e79a293f4dd3d82db0f78486", "ja": "やった（ぞ）～！", "zh": "太棒啦（喽）～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b7060cdf077616b32082b042ef971cbc690e4c5ca264b9bb784f4dc85d4cdbf", "ja": "やった～！", "zh": "太好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "8941ffa699c29b897984d407654fc0b1d7ef2c073f9717960276901fb4dd2f87", "ja": "うぎゃー！　自分はなんてダメなセンパイなんだー！\nこんな自分でゴメン、翼！　嫌いにならないで～！！", "zh": "哇啊——！自己到底算什么差劲的前辈啊——！\n是这样的自己真是对不起，翼！不要讨厌我～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d578d3df5a4022ce7e9514b2e61825a211940744dd111e5be3410f4044e235c4", "ja": "な、なりませんってば～！", "zh": "才、才不会变成那样啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "93d8553e5788acdd7bc8e5c321d9a10b9335c003550fc4430f3a139d0b83c990", "ja": "なんかね、頑張ってる時もキラキラして見えるの。\n見てるだけで、ドキドキしてくる気がする……。", "zh": "怎么说呢，努力的时候整个人都看起来闪闪发光的。\n感觉光是看着，心跳就会加速……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_501_il_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_il_07_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "0ef7ad8bc88013f5263c6688d2f1e28e9b18c884639f97920bd212351a7de75a", "ja": "つ、翼……。", "zh": "翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
